  "description": "AntJob extension components on top of the core SDK: SQL-driven, message-driven and dynamic-script scheduling modes. NativeAOT-ready, with built-in runtime localization; targets .NET Framework 4.5, .NET Standard 2.0/2.1 and .NET 8.0. 蚂蚁调度扩展库：在核心 SDK 之上提供 SQL 数据驱动、消息驱动与动态脚本等多种调度模式；原生 AOT 就绪，内置运行时多语言消息；单包覆盖 .NET Framework 4.5 至 .NET 8.0 共 4 个目标框架。",
  "iconFile": "ant.png",
